<resources>
    <!--
      Russian. Machine translation, reviewed for consistency of terminology.

      Left in English on purpose: "System", "Secure" and "Global" name Android's three
      settings tables, and a translated label would no longer match what the platform, its
      documentation or any adb command calls them. Shizuku is a product name.

      No em dashes anywhere in the Russian files, at the author's request, even though the
      em dash is the idiomatic connector in Russian: a colon, a comma or a plain hyphen is
      used instead and the sentence is restructured where neither fits.
    -->
